=== 1. the rect route agrees with the anchored route ===
  crop_rect(g, bbox(nonbg_mask g)) == crop_to_mask(g, nonbg_mask g)  on all: True

=== 2. the top reproduces ground truth ===
  train 0: ok
  train 1: ok
  train 2: ok
  test  3: ok
  d_raw (top inlined over the floor)   4  (min_depth_limit agrees)
  top's jump over L_1                  2  (min_depth_limit agrees)
  rung's jump over L_0                 3  (min_depth_limit agrees)

